  <page_number>173</page_number>
  <running_head>ABRA. SACRIFICANS.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">
      <i>Illuxerit orbi tunc refurgat mortuum,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>Fiatque simul beatitatis particeps.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="2" para="true">SATHANAS.</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">
      <i>Quidquid per omnes accidit terra plaga-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5">
      <i>sImmane, triste, turpe, detestabile,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>Cades cruenta, bella, parricidia,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">
      <i>Malesuada fames, pestis furens, incendia,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>Venena poclis mixta, fraudes impia,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>Direptiones orbium, libidines-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>Regum superba, plebium astus feruidi.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>Truces inimicitia, irreconciliabilis-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>Fratrum simultas, stupra, perfidia, insolens-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>Inceftus, atque rupta sincla fœderum,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>Hac cunctaque me recreant spectacula:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>Meam sed istius miseranda lacryma-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>Queftufque lamentabiles mentem movent.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17" type="heading" level="2" para="true">ABRAHAMVS.</l>
    <l n="18" para="true">
      <i>Hac summa nunc tandem tibi, nate, osculA-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>Libabo, teque cinget ultimis ferox-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>Hac nostra dextra amplexibus, prius tuo-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>Quam casus hanc aram cruore sparseris.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">
      <i>Vos testor ignes noctè tota lucidi,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>Turmaque syderum innumerabiles, mihi-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>Quas sape monstrauit Dominator atheris,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25">
      <i>Quum feculis promitteret surgentibus-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26">
      <i>Hunc hunc Ifacum plurimarum gentium-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27">
      <i>Fore progenitorem: teque iam iam quinquies-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="28">
      <i>Promissa testor terra posteris meis,</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Verse set as lines; long s rendered as s; catchword and signature absent. Doubtful: "osculA" and "sincla" may be misprinted.</notes>
